  "abstract": "Test tiny U-OrthoReg on normalized U alongside V-OrthoReg at the best LN base (k=320,p=32,H=96,\u03b3_end=0.99,a_max=0.993). Optimizer: Adam (no WD), MAE+curvature loss.",
